Package: trcpproject
Type: Package
Title: Create Standardized TRCP Analysis Projects
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
        "TRCP",
        "Brigitte",
        email = "brigitte.mueller@uhn.ca",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: 
    Interactive project scaffolding for standardized TRCP analysis projects.
    Creates a predefined folder structure, analysis scripts, Quarto reports,
    and optional Git repositories using analysis-specific templates. You need to run this using the one and only function `create_project()`. This function will ask you a series of questions about your project and then create the project structure for you. The function will create a README file that is automatically filled with the project name, analyst name, and date of creation as well as Sesssion Info! No need to remember that anymore. When you later work on a project, always read the README file first, then use the appropriate Dockerized Rversion.
